      "Tap": [
        {
          "Name": "main_1",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "SG，要时刻掌握指挥官的位置。要是在这副打扮下毫无防备地遇见指挥官的话，我会不知所措的……"
        },
        {
          "Name": "main_2",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_1_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_1_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "如果指挥官能夸我漂亮而不是可爱，那就……啊，并不是说可爱不好，而是…当，当然，怎么夸都是指挥官的自由，两边都夸也…啊呜…"
        },
        {
          "Name": "main_3",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_2_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_2_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "如果有什么事，请随时告诉我哦。以免让指挥官不安，我……不，我们在此都是为了这个目的呢",
          "TextDelay": 167
        },
        {
          "Name": "main_1_en",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "SG, track the Commander's exact location. If we meet before I've mentally prepared myself for it, I might just freak out...",
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "main_2_en",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_1_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_1_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "I like \"you're pretty\" over \"you're cute\" as a compliment... Oh, that doesn't mean you can't say I'm cute or anything... It's obviously up to you to decide how to compliment me, Commander, you can even use both, so... *whimper*...",
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "main_3_en",
          "File": "Motions_Tap_2_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_Tap_2_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "Just tell me if anything feels wrong. It's my... No, it's all our job to ensure you don't have anything to worry about.",
          "TextDelay": 167,
          "Language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "body": [
        {
          "Name": "touch_body",
          "File": "Motions_body_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_body_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "嗯，海伦娜听着呢。指挥官，怎么了？",
          "TextDelay": 167
        },
        {
          "Name": "touch_body_en",
          "File": "Motions_body_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_body_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "Mhm, I'm all ears. What is it, Commander?",
          "TextDelay": 167,
          "Language": "en"
        },
