      "select": [
        {
          "Name": "login",
          "File": "Motions_select_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "呼…风吹得真舒服。指挥官，一小会儿…就一小会儿，我想在你面前……变得大胆一点……",
          "FadeIn": 0
        },
        {
          "Name": "mission",
          "File": "Motions_select_1_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_1_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "指挥官，请先去完成任务吧，我会等你的",
          "TextDelay": 167
        },
        {
          "Name": "mission_complete",
          "File": "Motions_select_2_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_2_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 350,
          "Text": "指挥官真厉害呢",
          "TextDelay": 350
        },
        {
          "Name": "mail",
          "File": "Motions_select_3_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_3_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "有新邮件。指挥官，要现在查看吗？"
        },
        {
          "Name": "home",
          "File": "Motions_select_4_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_4_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "欢迎回来，指挥官。那个，如果你有空的话，我们要不去游一会儿…啊，刚从海边回来，又邀请你去海边…没关系吗？",
          "FadeIn": 0
        },
        {
          "Name": "wedding",
          "File": "Motions_select_5_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_5_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 250,
          "Text": "这就是指挥官给我的承诺吗……这样啊……好开心……",
          "TextDelay": 250,
          "FadeIn": 0
        },
        {
          "Name": "complete",
          "File": "Motions_select_6_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_6_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "委托组的大家已经回来了。不，不是SG告诉我的，是同伴告诉我的。至于是谁…是秘密哦"
        },
        {
          "Name": "login_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_0_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_0_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "Whew... This breeze is lovely... Hey, Commander, for just a brief moment, I was thinking I could... be more daring around you...",
          "FadeIn": 0,
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "mission_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_1_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_1_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 167,
          "Text": "Commander, please go complete your missions. Don't worry, I'll be here waiting for you.",
          "TextDelay": 167,
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "mission_complete_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_2_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_2_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 350,
          "Text": "You really are incredible, Commander.",
          "TextDelay": 350,
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "mail_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_3_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_3_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "A letter has arrived. Do you want to read it now?",
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "home_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_4_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_4_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "Welcome back, Commander. If you, uh, have a moment, we could go for a swim... I know you just got back from the ocean, but... still?",
          "FadeIn": 0,
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "wedding_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_5_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_5_Sound_0.wav",
          "SoundDelay": 250,
          "Text": "A promise... from you, Commander? I see... I'm so happy...",
          "TextDelay": 250,
          "FadeIn": 0,
          "Language": "en"
        },
        {
          "Name": "complete_en",
          "File": "Motions_select_6_File_0.json",
          "Sound": "Motions_select_6_Sound_0.wav",
          "Text": "The commission team is back. No, it wasn't my SG that told me, but a friend. As for who... that's a secret.",
          "Language": "en"
        }
      ],
